{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"e24f1d01b6f0449dc6abd4db50709723d1ca0e09fd596d5eda77710dc1a59c01","slug":"introduction","location":"/introduction.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"现代的 CMake 的介绍","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Henry Schreiner","given":"Henry","family":"Schreiner"},"name":"Henry Schreiner","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"github":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN","copyright":"2024","source_url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/blob/main/introduction.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/Modern-CMake-CN/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/edit/main/introduction.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"introduction.md","url":"/Modern-CMake-zh_CN/_public/introduction-26fc244853227e408f224a48afc1a72a.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":11,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人们喜欢对构建系统抱有敌意。\nCppCon17 的讲座就是一个开发者们将构建系统当成头等笑话的例子。\n这引出了一个问题：为什么（人们这样认为）？\n确实，使用构建系统构建项目时不乏这样那样的问题。\n但我认为，我们有一个非常好的解决方案来消除其中的一些问题。\n那就是 CMake 。但不是 CMake 2.8 ，它比 C++11 还要早出现。\n也不是那些糟糕的 CMake 例程（甚至包括那些 KitWare 自己的教程里发布的例子）。\n我指的是现代的 CMake 。是 CMake 3.15+ ，甚至是 CMake 4.4+ ！\n它简洁、强大、优雅，所以你能够花费你的大部分时间在编写代码上，而不是在一个不可读、不可维护的 Make （或 CMake 2） 文件上浪费时间。","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"jL915Xqgdy"}],"key":"HMHh2yjtQZ"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"attention","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attention","key":"F3758U3NKz"}],"key":"dAAxl3rm6y"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本书是一篇持续维护的文档。你可以在 ","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"qWmmd8c4hh"},{"type":"link","url":"https://gitlab.com/CLIUtils/modern-cmake","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1},"end":{"line":1