":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"key":"fwpQGA12Gt"}],"key":"z8aHGeZ1uk"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"为什么答案一定是CMake？","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"DdNwc9bQlj"}],"identifier":"id-cmake","label":"为什么答案一定是CMake？","html_id":"id-cmake","implicit":true,"key":"qgZNUnJ9ju"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":47,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"构建系统是一个热门话题。当然，有很多构建系统可选。但是，即使是一个真的非常好的构建系统，或者一个使用类似（CMake）的语法的，也不能达到 CMake 的使用体验。\n为什么？\n因为生态。\n每个 IDE 都支持 CMake（或者是 CMake 支持那个 IDE）。\n使用 CMake 构建的软件包比使用其他任何构建系统的都多。\n所以，如果你想要在你的代码中包含一个库，你有两个选择，要么自己写一个构建系统，要么使用该库支持的构建系统中的某个。而那通常包含 CMake。\n如何你的工程包含的库多了，CMake 或很快成为那些库所支持的构建系统的交集。并且，如果你使用一个预装在系统中的库，它有很大可能有一个 find CMake 或者是一个 config CMake 的脚本。","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"ZvvU4pL5C0"}],"key":"JlZISYeAIC"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"我难道不应该支持尽可能老的版本吗？","position":{"start":{"line":49,"column":1},"end":{"line":49,"column":1}},"key":"a44WYnQeZf"}],"identifier":"id","label":"我难道不应该支持尽可能老的版本吗？","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"vlIC9273HH"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"简短的回答：不应该。","position":{"start":{"line":51,"column":1},"end":{"line":51,"column":1}},"key":"jZr8bpglEF"}],"key":"fYi17JuHrh"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"如果你将 CMake 的最低版本设置得太低，CMake 会产生警告甚至报错。截至 CMake 4.4，你能设置的最老版本是 3.5，且任何低于 3.10 的设置都会触发警告。虽然用户在紧急情况下可以通过将 ","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"key":"uaut2faQN1"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"key":"rqCOdQQ6lv"},{"type":"text","value":" 设置为有效版本来绕过这一限制，但你并不希望用户不得不这么做。","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"key":"wwgoYY7Num"}],"key":"AEuC7mr9bF"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"你应该至少使用在你的编译器之后出现的 CMake 版本，因为它需要知道该版本的编译器标志等信息。\n而且，由于 CMake 只会启用 CMakeLists.txt 中包含的最低 CMake 版本所对应的特性，所以即使是在系统范围内安装一个新版本的 CMake 也是相当安全的。\n你至少应该在本地安装它。这很容易（在许多情况下是 1-2 行命令），你会发现 5 分钟的工作将为你节省数百行和数小时的 CMakeLists.txt 编写，而且从长远来看，将更容易维护。","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"x8YqIseiWj"}],"key":"BIF829Au4E"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"合适的最低版本快速总结（书中会有更详细的介绍）：","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"key":"R3h0hMLeHB"}],"key":"PCwcPjXebB"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":67,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.24：包查找系统非常出色，适合作为支持包作者的良好最低版本。","position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"key":"Sif6I1hBIT"}],"key":"UNq68bg0hj"}],"key":"deyjbrkKh5"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":62,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3.18：对 Python 和 CUDA 有相当好的支持，大多数系统至少都具备此版本。","position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":62,"column":1}},"key":"Pt6VMm7vuN"}],"key":"gxJnTWBiM5"}],"key":"TcZmrzrjiJ"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":63,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type"